{"id":"vod_md_4093","vodId":"4093","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"黄金拼图","name_cn":"黄金拼图","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230903-1/c566a1638cea7fbf40eba6cb9bd7676f.jpg"},"summary":"大宫忍（西明日香 配音）是一位平凡的十五岁少女，黑瞳黑发，从头到尾，从里到外都是标准日本少女样貌的她，其实有过寄宿在英国家庭的经历。忍的个性成熟而又稳重，温文尔雅，但却又十分执着，有着自己的主意和想法，不会轻易动摇。回到日本后，忍意外的收到了一封来信，写信的是名叫爱丽丝（田中真奈美 配音）英国少女，她是忍在英国寄宿家庭房东的女儿。爱丽丝告诉忍，这一次，她决定前往日本，来忍家寄宿。追随爱丽丝而来的，是她的青梅竹马九条可怜（东山奈央 配音），拥有典型外国人样貌的她实际上是混血儿。围绕着三位活泼可爱的少女，充满了快乐和温馨的校园喜剧正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-03 10:15:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/O7e5GLIR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/DZPyWq9l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/LehoUlHN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/UcAkddUA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/BnoPGL5c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/RCOEFKIk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/8m2IUewV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/HQww1OJm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/jnAvDHmF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/MZxduZNt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/u2VD53Bv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/D2yWKpMQ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:45.667Z"}